	(generator "hand")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "CKCS BS01 5V->12V mini boost module (4R7 coil revision), mounted face up on 4 straight male pins. Pad centers measured off ruler photos of the real module (+-0.15mm): IN-/IN+ 3.90mm apart, OUT+/OUT- 7.90mm apart, IN to OUT 17.75mm. Board ~21.6x10.7mm (listed 22x11). Print 1:1 and dry-fit before ordering.")
